title: National Day of Catalonia (2016)
view-if: year = 2016 and month = 9 and not rubicon
tags: event
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: diada2016_response = null
set-bg: img/diada/2010.jpg
face-image: img/diada/2016.jpg
role: event

= We are ready!

This year, the National Day of Catalonia acts organized by the ANC and Omnium Cultural have been decentralized, with demonstrations planned in many Catalan cities beyond Barcelona. The acts will focus on different goals of the future Republic, under the slogan "We are ready!".

- @join
- @force
- @pass

@join
title: Join the demonstration!
choose-if: player_roadmap > 0 and not broken_roadmap and (not ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or independence_trust >= 40)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if player_roadmap <= 0: We have no Roadmap to Independence. ?][? if broken_roadmap: Given our broken promises, we are unwelcome here. ?][? if ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and independence_trust < 40: The organization's lack of trust in our action in government makes us unwelcome here.  ?]
on-arrival: diada2016_response = "join"
go-to: report

@force
title: We'll join, and help out organizing so that it is a success!
subtitle: Our party apparatus will mobilize in force for this. \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: player_roadmap > 0 and not broken_roadmap and (not ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or independence_trust >= 40) and party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if player_roadmap <= 0: We have no Roadmap to Independence. ?][? if broken_roadmap: Given our broken promises, we are unwelcome here. ?][? if ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and independence_trust < 40:  The organization's lack of trust in our action in government makes us unwelcome here. ?][? if party_resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: diada2016_response = "force"
go-to: report

@pass
title: Stay on the sidelines
on-arrival: diada2016_response = "pass"
go-to: report

@report
on-arrival: {!
    var response = Q.diada2016_response;
    var option = this.game.scenes['2016diada.' + response];
    // Check participation before the demonstration's own trust increase.
    if (Q.year == 2016 && Q.month == 9 && !Q.rubicon && option &&
        this._runPredicate(option.chooseIf, true)) {
        // Diada 2016 — post-27S disillusionment, CUP-CDC budget gridlock, smaller crowds.
        // Effect AND street turnout decided dynamically from current state (existing Q
        // vars only). Model + rationale: simulations/diada_dynamics.py.
        var IM = Q.independence_movement, IT = Q.independence_trust;
        Q.diada2016_trust = IT;
        var SD = Q.social_dissent, CSR = Q.cat_spa_relations;
        var pod = Q.podemos_channeling || 0;
        var clamp = function (x, lo, hi) { return Math.max(lo, Math.min(hi, x)); };

        // Situational reads (existing bool flags; absent => false). A referendum/consulta
        // IS street action (mobilises); a caretaker government means an ordinary election
        // is near, which drains the marginal effect to the ballot — but still draws crowds.
        var mobilise = (Q.referendum_pending || Q.consultation_pending) ? 1 : 0;
        var channel  = Q.cat_caretaker_gov ? 1 : 0;

        // Magnitude: autonomous street floor (IM-IT gap, widest when parties haven't earned
        // trust) + mobilisation, amplified by antagonism, drained by an imminent election.
        var gap   = Math.max(0, IM - IT);
        var antag = clamp(1 + 0.5 * (40 - CSR) / 40, 0.4, 1.6);
        var mag   = clamp((1.5 + 0.18 * gap + 5.0 * mobilise) * antag * (1 - 0.45 * channel), 0, 16);

        // Valence: hope by default; grief (the sign flips) in the repression aftermath —
        // broken roadmap + relations on the floor + anger (dissent) still unspent.
        var grief = 0;
        if (Q.broken_roadmap) {
            grief = clamp((20 - CSR) / 15, 0, 1) * clamp((SD - 48) / 10, 0, 1);
        }
        var valence = 1 - 2 * grief;

        // Political effect (post_event clamps each variable afterwards).
        Q.independence_movement += mag * valence;
        Q.independence_trust    += 0.22 * mag * valence;
        Q.social_dissent        += -0.22 * mag * valence * (1 - 0.6 * pod);
        Q.cat_spa_relations     += -0.30 * mag;

        // Street turnout for flavour text, in millions of participants (display only).
        var turnoutAnchor = 0.75;
        var stateAdjustment = clamp(
            0.008 * (IM - 60) + 0.006 * (gap - 25) + 0.004 * (40 - CSR),
            -0.35, 0.35
        );
        var voteBoost = 0.20 * mobilise + 0.05 * channel;
        Q.diada_size = clamp((turnoutAnchor + stateAdjustment + voteBoost) * (1 - 0.40 * grief), 0.2, 2.0);
        Q.diada_size = Math.round(Q.diada_size * 100) / 100;
        // Party participation adds to the autonomous mobilization above.
        if (response == "join" || response == "force") {
            var inGovernment = (Q.player_party == "erc" && Q.erc_in_gob) ||
                (Q.player_party == "cup" && Q.cup_in_gob) ||
                (Q.player_in_jxsi && Q.jxsi_in_gob) || (Q.player_in_jxcat && Q.jxcat_in_gob);
            var inForce = response == "force";
            if (inForce) Q.party_resources -= 1;
            Q.independence_movement += inForce ? 3 : 1;
            Q.cat_spa_relations -= inForce ? 5 : 1;
            if (inForce && inGovernment) Q.independence_trust += 3;
            Q.diada_size = Math.round(clamp(Q.diada_size * (inForce ? 1.10 : 1.05), 0.2, 2.0) * 100) / 100;
        }
    }
!}

The decentralized protests for independence across Catalonia have, this year, filled the streets of many cities and towns beyond those of Barcelona. Now about being "Ready" for the Catalan Republic, the acts have focused on different goals of the future Republic in different cities, from solidarity and diversity, to culture, territorial equilibrium, and civil freedoms. With a combined assistance of [+ diada_size +] million, the acts have once again remained peaceful and festive.

The protest was supported by [? if (diada2016_trust >= 40 or not (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob)): [+ parlament_current_ciu +], ?][? if ((player_party != "cup" or diada2016_response != "pass") and (diada2016_trust >= 40 or not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): the CUP, ?][? if ((player_party != "erc" or diada2016_response != "pass") and (diada2016_trust >= 40 or not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): ERC, ?][? if (diada2016_trust >= 40 or not (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob)) or ((player_party != "cup" or diada2016_response != "pass") and (diada2016_trust >= 40 or not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))) or ((player_party != "erc" or diada2016_response != "pass") and (diada2016_trust >= 40 or not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): and ?]many other minor parties and organizations.
[? if diada2016_trust < 40 and ((cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob) or (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))): The organizers made it clear that representatives of [? if (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob): [+ parlament_current_ciu +][? if (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)):,?] [? if ((erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))) or ((cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))): and ?]?][? if (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): ERC [? if (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): and ?]?][? if (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): the CUP ?]were not welcome, given the lack of commitment to independence while in government. ?]

- @continue
- @riots

@continue
title: Continue...
view-if: diada2016_trust >= 40 and not rubicon
go-to: post_event

@riots
title: Not everything is just a festive celebration, though...
view-if: diada2016_trust < 40 or rubicon
go-to: diada_riots
